<script data-page="app" type="application/json">{"component":"flashcards\/study","props":{"errors":{},"name":"Topwords","auth":{"user":{"id":5,"name":"\u00c1rp\u00e1d Szaniszl\u00f3","email":"developedbybarley@gmail.com","email_verified_at":null,"two_factor_confirmed_at":null,"streak":12,"quiz_completions":1,"text_analyses":14,"last_activity_date":"2026-05-15T00:00:00.000000Z","onboarding_completed_at":"2026-04-18T19:40:25.000000Z","created_at":"2026-04-18T19:40:03.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-05-15T20:26:09.000000Z","stripe_id":"cus_UR8u0ziMkWwJIo","pm_type":null,"pm_last_four":null,"trial_ends_at":null,"ai_access":false,"subscriptions":[]},"isAdmin":true,"subscription":{"hasActiveAccess":true,"isSubscribed":false,"isPremium":false,"hasAiAccess":false,"isOnTrial":false}},"sidebarOpen":true,"flash":{"streakTriggered":null,"success":null,"achievements":[],"calibrationPrompt":null,"showTour":false,"importedCardId":null},"deck":{"id":10,"name":"Prev"},"cards":[{"id":51318,"front":"<p>The old, abandoned house was known for its _______ occurrences, with strange lights and whispers reported by many. <em>(k\u00eds\u00e9rteties \/ szellemszer\u0171)<\/em><\/p><p>Scientists used _______ analysis to identify the chemical composition of the distant star, examining the different wavelengths of light it emitted. <em>(spektr\u00e1lis \/ sz\u00ednk\u00e9pelemz\u0151)<\/em><\/p><p>After the tragic event, a _______ silence fell over the crowd, a chilling quiet that spoke volumes. <em>(k\u00eds\u00e9rteties \/ borzongat\u00f3)<\/em><\/p><p>Her performance had a _______ quality, as if she were a ghost dancing on stage, captivating the audience with her ethereal movements. <em>(szellemszer\u0171 \/ \u00e9terikus)<\/em><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #22c55e\">k\u00eds\u00e9rteties \/ szellemszer\u0171 \/ spektr\u00e1lis<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"background-color: #f3f4f6; padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px\">Negative meaning (HU): val\u00f3s\u00e1gos \/ k\u00e9zzelfoghat\u00f3 \/ anyagi<\/span><\/p><p>\ud83d\udd11 Tanul\u00e1si megjegyz\u00e9s<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ analysis = spektr\u00e1lis anal\u00edzis (pl. The lab conducted _______ analysis to identify the unknown substance.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ presence = k\u00eds\u00e9rteties jelenl\u00e9t (pl. Many reported a _______ presence in the old mansion.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ light = spektr\u00e1lis f\u00e9ny \/ k\u00eds\u00e9rteties f\u00e9ny (pl. The aurora borealis displayed a dazzling array of _______ light.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ silence = k\u00eds\u00e9rteties csend (pl. A _______ silence fell over the empty stadium.)<\/p>","front_notes":null,"front_speak":null,"back":"<p><strong>spectral<\/strong><\/p><p>adjective: <strong>spectral<\/strong><\/p><p>adverb: <strong>spectrally<\/strong><\/p><p>noun: <strong>spectrum<\/strong><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #3b82f6\">common pair: spectral analysis \/ spectral presence \/ spectral light \/ spectral image<\/span><\/p><p>similar: ghostly \/ phantom \/ eerie \/ supernatural<\/p><p><span style=\"color: #ef4444\">negative: real \/ tangible \/ corporeal<\/span><\/p>","back_notes":null,"back_speak":"spectral\nspectrally","study_direction":"front_to_back","color":"#6366f1","review":{"state":"new","interval":0,"lapses":0,"is_leech":false},"previews":{"again":"1 perc","hard":"2 perc","good":"10 perc","easy":"2 nap"},"other_side_due_at":null},{"id":51294,"front":"<p>I have no idea _______ what happened to the keys. <em>(egy\u00e1ltal\u00e1n \/ semmif\u00e9le)<\/em><\/p><p>There was no evidence _______ to suggest he was involved. <em>(egy\u00e1ltal\u00e1n \/ semmi)<\/em><\/p><p>She received no support _______ from her family during the difficult time. <em>(semmilyen \/ egy\u00e1ltal\u00e1n)<\/em><\/p><p>The new policy had no impact _______ on the company&#039;s profits. <em>(egy\u00e1ltal\u00e1n \/ semmi)<\/em><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #22c55e\">egy\u00e1ltal\u00e1n \/ semmilyen \/ semmi<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"background-color: #f3f4f6; padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px\">Negative meaning (HU): valamennyi \/ b\u00e1rmilyen \/ sok<\/span><\/p><p>\ud83d\udd11 Tanul\u00e1si megjegyz\u00e9s<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 nothing _______ = egy\u00e1ltal\u00e1n semmi (pl. There was nothing _______ left.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 no one _______ = egy\u00e1ltal\u00e1n senki (pl. No one _______ believed him.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 none _______ = egy\u00e1ltal\u00e1n egy sem (pl. None _______ of them showed up.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 no reason _______ = egy\u00e1ltal\u00e1n semmi ok (pl. There&#039;s no reason _______ to worry.)<\/p>","front_notes":null,"front_speak":null,"back":"<p><strong>whatsoever<\/strong><\/p><p>adverb: <strong>whatsoever<\/strong><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #3b82f6\">common pair: nothing whatsoever \/ no one whatsoever \/ none whatsoever \/ no reason whatsoever<\/span><\/p><p>similar: at all \/ in any way \/ of any kind \/ in the slightest<\/p><p><span style=\"color: #ef4444\">negative: any \/ some \/ a lot<\/span><\/p>","back_notes":null,"back_speak":null,"study_direction":"back_to_front","color":"#6366f1","review":{"state":"learning","interval":0,"lapses":0,"is_leech":false},"previews":{"again":"1 perc","hard":"1.5 \u00f3ra","good":"2 \u00f3ra","easy":"2 nap"},"other_side_due_at":"2026-05-13T11:50:32+00:00"},{"id":51301,"front":"<p>The meeting will be postponed _______ a new venue can be secured. <em>(am\u00edg \/ addig, am\u00edg)<\/em><\/p><p>We will continue to monitor the situation _______ we receive further instructions. <em>(mindaddig, am\u00edg \/ eg\u00e9szen addig, am\u00edg)<\/em><\/p><p>The interim government will remain in power _______ elections can be held. <em>(arra az id\u0151re, am\u00edg \/ addig az id\u0151pontig, am\u00edg)<\/em><\/p><p>He vowed to search for her _______ he drew his last breath. <em>(am\u00edg csak \/ eg\u00e9szen addig, am\u00edg)<\/em><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #22c55e\">am\u00edg \/ addig, am\u00edg \/ mindaddig, am\u00edg<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"background-color: #f3f4f6; padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px\">Negative meaning (HU): azonnal \/ r\u00f6gt\u00f6n \/ halad\u00e9ktalanul<\/span><\/p><p>\ud83d\udd11 Tanul\u00e1si megjegyz\u00e9s<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 wait _______ = v\u00e1r am\u00edg (pl. We will wait _______ the rain stops.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 postpone _______ = elhalaszt am\u00edg (pl. The decision was postponed _______ further data is available.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 continue _______ = folytat am\u00edg (pl. They will continue _______ the project is complete.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 remain _______ = marad am\u00edg (pl. He will remain in charge _______ a new manager is appointed.)<\/p>","front_notes":null,"front_speak":null,"back":"<p><strong>until such a time<\/strong><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #3b82f6\">common pair: until such a time as \/ until such a time that \/ wait until such a time \/ postpone until such a time<\/span><\/p><p>similar: until \/ up until \/ pending \/ until then<\/p><p><span style=\"color: #ef4444\">negative: immediately \/ at once \/ straight away<\/span><\/p>","back_notes":null,"back_speak":"until such a time","study_direction":"front_to_back","color":"#6366f1","review":{"state":"learning","interval":0,"lapses":0,"is_leech":false},"previews":{"again":"1 perc","hard":"2 perc","good":"10 perc","easy":"2 nap"},"other_side_due_at":"2026-05-16T18:10:04+00:00"},{"id":51295,"front":"<p>The tall grass began to _______ gently in the evening breeze. <em>(ringat\u00f3zik \/ lengedezik)<\/em><\/p><p>Despite the strong arguments, he refused to _______ from his original position. <em>(elt\u00e9r \/ enged)<\/em><\/p><p>The politician&#039;s charismatic speech was designed to _______ public opinion. <em>(befoly\u00e1sol \/ ir\u00e1ny\u00edt)<\/em><\/p><p>The ship began to _______ dangerously in the rough seas, making many passengers seasick. <em>(ingadozik \/ d\u00fcl\u00f6ng\u00e9l)<\/em><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #22c55e\">ingat \/ befoly\u00e1sol \/ ringat\u00f3zik<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"background-color: #f3f4f6; padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px\">Negative meaning (HU): stabiliz\u00e1l \/ megszil\u00e1rd\u00edt \/ ellen\u00e1ll<\/span><\/p><p>\ud83d\udd11 Tanul\u00e1si megjegyz\u00e9s<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 to _______ public opinion = befoly\u00e1solja a k\u00f6zv\u00e9lem\u00e9nyt (pl. His powerful speech began to _______ public opinion in his favor.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 to _______ back and forth = ide-oda ringat\u00f3zik (pl. The hammock began to _______ back and forth in the gentle wind.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 under the _______ of = valaki\/valami befoly\u00e1sa alatt (pl. The decision was made under the strong _______ of the CEO.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 to _______ with the music = ringat\u00f3zik a zene \u00fctem\u00e9re (pl. She began to _______ with the music, lost in the rhythm.)<\/p>","front_notes":null,"front_speak":null,"back":"<p><strong>sway<\/strong><\/p><p>noun: <strong>sway<\/strong><\/p><p>verb: <strong>sway<\/strong><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #3b82f6\">common pair: sway public opinion \/ sway back and forth \/ hold sway \/ sway from<\/span><\/p><p>similar: influence \/ oscillate \/ waver \/ dominate<\/p><p><span style=\"color: #ef4444\">negative: stabilize \/ remain firm \/ resist<\/span><\/p>","back_notes":null,"back_speak":null,"study_direction":"back_to_front","color":"#6366f1","review":{"state":"learning","interval":0,"lapses":0,"is_leech":false},"previews":{"again":"1 perc","hard":"45 perc","good":"1 \u00f3ra","easy":"2 nap"},"other_side_due_at":"2026-05-16T23:08:27+00:00"},{"id":51317,"front":"<p>Don&#039;t be such a _______; just tell him what you think! <em>(gy\u00e1va \/ pipogyas\u00e1g)<\/em><\/p><p>He was called a _______ for not standing up to the bully. <em>(gy\u00e1va ember \/ ny\u00e1mnyila)<\/em><\/p><p>After his team lost, the coach accused some players of being _______s. <em>(gy\u00e1va j\u00e1t\u00e9kos \/ er\u0151tlens\u00e9g)<\/em><\/p><p>She refused to be a _______ and confronted her fears head-on. <em>(gy\u00e1va alak \/ f\u00e9l\u00e9nk ember)<\/em><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #22c55e\">gy\u00e1va \/ ny\u00e1mnyila \/ pipogyas\u00e1g<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"background-color: #f3f4f6; padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px\">Negative meaning (HU): b\u00e1tor \/ h\u0151s \/ mer\u00e9sz<\/span><\/p><p>\ud83d\udd11 Tanul\u00e1si megjegyz\u00e9s<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 don&#039;t be a _______ = ne l\u00e9gy gy\u00e1va (pl. Don&#039;t be a _______, just try it!)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 a complete _______ = egy igazi gy\u00e1va (pl. He was a complete _______ when it came to asking her out.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 feel like a _______ = gy\u00e1v\u00e1nak \u00e9rzi mag\u00e1t (pl. I felt like a _______ for not speaking up.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 call someone a _______ = gy\u00e1v\u00e1nak nevez valakit (pl. He called me a _______ for refusing to jump.)<\/p>","front_notes":null,"front_speak":null,"back":"<p><strong>wimp<\/strong><\/p><p>adjective: <strong>wimpy<\/strong><\/p><p>noun: <strong>wimp<\/strong><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #3b82f6\">common pair: total wimp \/ big wimp \/ scared wimp \/ little wimp<\/span><\/p><p>similar: coward \/ chicken \/ milksop \/ weakling<\/p><p><span style=\"color: #ef4444\">negative: hero \/ brave \/ daredevil<\/span><\/p>","back_notes":null,"back_speak":"wimp\nwimpy","study_direction":"back_to_front","color":"#6366f1","review":{"state":"learning","interval":0,"lapses":0,"is_leech":false},"previews":{"again":"1 perc","hard":"1.5 \u00f3ra","good":"2 \u00f3ra","easy":"2 nap"},"other_side_due_at":"2026-05-16T17:09:12+00:00"},{"id":51294,"front":"<p>I have no idea _______ what happened to the keys. <em>(egy\u00e1ltal\u00e1n \/ semmif\u00e9le)<\/em><\/p><p>There was no evidence _______ to suggest he was involved. <em>(egy\u00e1ltal\u00e1n \/ semmi)<\/em><\/p><p>She received no support _______ from her family during the difficult time. <em>(semmilyen \/ egy\u00e1ltal\u00e1n)<\/em><\/p><p>The new policy had no impact _______ on the company&#039;s profits. <em>(egy\u00e1ltal\u00e1n \/ semmi)<\/em><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #22c55e\">egy\u00e1ltal\u00e1n \/ semmilyen \/ semmi<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"background-color: #f3f4f6; padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px\">Negative meaning (HU): valamennyi \/ b\u00e1rmilyen \/ sok<\/span><\/p><p>\ud83d\udd11 Tanul\u00e1si megjegyz\u00e9s<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 nothing _______ = egy\u00e1ltal\u00e1n semmi (pl. There was nothing _______ left.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 no one _______ = egy\u00e1ltal\u00e1n senki (pl. No one _______ believed him.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 none _______ = egy\u00e1ltal\u00e1n egy sem (pl. None _______ of them showed up.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 no reason _______ = egy\u00e1ltal\u00e1n semmi ok (pl. There&#039;s no reason _______ to worry.)<\/p>","front_notes":null,"front_speak":null,"back":"<p><strong>whatsoever<\/strong><\/p><p>adverb: <strong>whatsoever<\/strong><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #3b82f6\">common pair: nothing whatsoever \/ no one whatsoever \/ none whatsoever \/ no reason whatsoever<\/span><\/p><p>similar: at all \/ in any way \/ of any kind \/ in the slightest<\/p><p><span style=\"color: #ef4444\">negative: any \/ some \/ a lot<\/span><\/p>","back_notes":null,"back_speak":null,"study_direction":"front_to_back","color":"#6366f1","review":{"state":"learning","interval":0,"lapses":0,"is_leech":false},"previews":{"again":"1 perc","hard":"2 perc","good":"10 perc","easy":"2 nap"},"other_side_due_at":"2026-05-13T12:46:47+00:00"},{"id":51314,"front":"<p>Everyone was invited to _______ in the celebratory feast. <em>(r\u00e9szt vesz \/ eszik)<\/em><\/p><p>The community members were encouraged to _______ in the decision-making process. <em>(r\u00e9szt vesz \/ kiveszi a r\u00e9sz\u00e9t)<\/em><\/p><p>Researchers often _______ in collaborative projects to share expertise and resources. <em>(k\u00f6zrem\u0171k\u00f6dik \/ r\u00e9szt vesz)<\/em><\/p><p>She chose not to _______ in the gossip, preferring to remain neutral. <em>(r\u00e9szt vesz \/ belekeveredik)<\/em><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #22c55e\">r\u00e9szt vesz \/ kiveszi a r\u00e9sz\u00e9t \/ osztozik<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"background-color: #f3f4f6; padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px\">Negative meaning (HU): kimarad \/ t\u00e1vol marad \/ mell\u0151z<\/span><\/p><p>\ud83d\udd11 Tanul\u00e1si megjegyz\u00e9s<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 to _______ in something = r\u00e9szt venni valamiben (pl. He wanted to partake in the discussion.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 to _______ of something = r\u00e9szes\u00fclni valamib\u0151l, enni\/inni valamib\u0151l (pl. They partook of the bread and wine.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 to _______ in a meal\/feast = r\u00e9szt venni egy \u00e9tkez\u00e9sen\/lakom\u00e1n (pl. null)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 to _______ in a ritual\/ceremony = r\u00e9szt venni egy ritu\u00e1l\u00e9n\/szertart\u00e1son (pl. null)<\/p>","front_notes":null,"front_speak":null,"back":"<p><strong>partake<\/strong><\/p><p>noun: <strong>partaker<\/strong><\/p><p>verb: <strong>partake<\/strong><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #3b82f6\">common pair: partake in a meal \/ partake of food \/ partake in an activity \/ partake in a discussion<\/span><\/p><p>similar: participate \/ share \/ engage \/ take part<\/p><p><span style=\"color: #ef4444\">negative: abstain \/ forgo \/ refrain<\/span><\/p>","back_notes":null,"back_speak":"partake","study_direction":"front_to_back","color":"#6366f1","review":{"state":"learning","interval":0,"lapses":0,"is_leech":false},"previews":{"again":"1 perc","hard":"45 perc","good":"1 \u00f3ra","easy":"2 nap"},"other_side_due_at":"2026-05-16T18:09:52+00:00"},{"id":51321,"front":"<p>For a healthy breakfast, I often have a bowl of _______ with milk and fruit. <em>(zabk\u00e1sa \/ reggeli gabonapehely)<\/em><\/p><p>The farmer cultivated a large field of _______ to feed his livestock during the winter months. <em>(zab \/ takarm\u00e1nyn\u00f6v\u00e9ny)<\/em><\/p><p>Research suggests that regular consumption of _______ can help lower cholesterol levels due to its high fiber content. <em>(zabpehely \/ gabonaf\u00e9le)<\/em><\/p><p>The old mill used to grind various grains, including wheat and _______, into flour. <em>(zab \/ \u0151r\u00f6lt gabona)<\/em><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #22c55e\">zab \/ zabpehely \/ zabk\u00e1sa<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"background-color: #f3f4f6; padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px\">Negative meaning (HU): b\u00faza \/ rizs \/ kukorica<\/span><\/p><p>\ud83d\udd11 Tanul\u00e1si megjegyz\u00e9s<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 rolled _______ = hengerelt zabpehely (pl. She made cookies with rolled _______.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 steel-cut _______ = v\u00e1gott zabpehely (pl. Steel-cut _______ take longer to cook but have a chewier texture.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ porridge = zabk\u00e1sa (pl. A warm bowl of _______ porridge is perfect on a cold morning.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 wild _______ = vadzab (pl. Wild _______ can be found growing in many fields.)<\/p>","front_notes":null,"front_speak":null,"back":"<p><strong>oats<\/strong><\/p><p>noun: <strong>oats<\/strong><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #3b82f6\">common pair: oats and honey \/ oats for breakfast \/ oats in baking \/ oats for horses<\/span><\/p><p>similar: oatmeal \/ porridge \/ groats \/ cereals<\/p><p><span style=\"color: #ef4444\">negative: wheat \/ rice \/ corn<\/span><\/p>","back_notes":null,"back_speak":"oats","study_direction":"back_to_front","color":"#6366f1","review":{"state":"learning","interval":0,"lapses":0,"is_leech":false},"previews":{"again":"1 perc","hard":"15 perc","good":"30 perc","easy":"2 nap"},"other_side_due_at":null},{"id":51299,"front":"<p>The old butler had been a loyal _______ to the family for over fifty years. <em>(szolga \/ csel\u00e9d)<\/em><\/p><p>In many historical dramas, the _______ class often plays a significant role in the household&#039;s daily operations. <em>(szolg\u00e1l\u00f3 \/ h\u00e1ziszolga)<\/em><\/p><p>He viewed his role as a public _______, dedicated to serving the needs of his constituents. <em>(k\u00f6zszolga \/ hivatalnok)<\/em><\/p><p>The novel explored the complex relationship between master and _______ in a rigid social hierarchy. <em>(szolga \/ al\u00e1rendelt)<\/em><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #22c55e\">szolga \/ csel\u00e9d \/ k\u00f6zszolga<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"background-color: #f3f4f6; padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px\">Negative meaning (HU): \u00far \/ gazda \/ mester<\/span><\/p><p>\ud83d\udd11 Tanul\u00e1si megjegyz\u00e9s<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 public _______ = k\u00f6zszolga (pl. As a public _______, he was accountable to the citizens.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 loyal _______ = h\u0171s\u00e9ges szolga (pl. She was a loyal _______ to the queen.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 domestic _______ = h\u00e1ziszolga (pl. The family employed several domestic _______s.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 civil _______ = \u00e1llami alkalmazott (pl. He worked as a civil _______ for the government.)<\/p>","front_notes":null,"front_speak":null,"back":"<p><strong>servant<\/strong><\/p><p>noun: <strong>servant<\/strong><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #3b82f6\">common pair: public servant \/ loyal servant \/ domestic servant \/ civil servant<\/span><\/p><p>similar: attendant \/ aide \/ domestic \/ retainer<\/p><p><span style=\"color: #ef4444\">negative: master \/ employer \/ lord<\/span><\/p>","back_notes":null,"back_speak":null,"study_direction":"front_to_back","color":"#6366f1","review":{"state":"learning","interval":0,"lapses":0,"is_leech":false},"previews":{"again":"1 perc","hard":"9 \u00f3ra","good":"1 nap","easy":"2 nap"},"other_side_due_at":"2026-05-18T17:06:05+00:00"},{"id":51305,"front":"<p>He suffered a severe _______ that left him partially paralyzed on one side. <em>(sz\u00e9l\u00fct\u00e9s \/ agyi \u00e9rkatasztr\u00f3fa)<\/em><\/p><p>With a gentle _______ of the cat&#039;s fur, she calmed it down. <em>(simogat\u00e1s \/ \u00e9rint\u00e9s)<\/em><\/p><p>The artist&#039;s bold brush _______ defined the dramatic landscape. <em>(ecsetvon\u00e1s \/ von\u00e1s)<\/em><\/p><p