niture. <em>(\u00fatmutat\u00e1st ad \/ t\u00e1j\u00e9koztat)<\/em><\/p><p>Before you begin, I must _______ you to proceed with caution. <em>(utas\u00edt\u00e1st ad \/ felsz\u00f3l\u00edt)<\/em><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #22c55e\">utas\u00edt \/ oktat \/ tan\u00edt<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"background-color: #f3f4f6; padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px\">Negative meaning (HU): f\u00e9lrevezet \/ elt\u00e9veszt \/ nem tan\u00edt<\/span><\/p><p>\ud83d\udd11 Tanul\u00e1si megjegyz\u00e9s<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 to _______ someone to do something = utas\u00edtani valakit valamire (pl. The manager will _______ the team to complete the report by Friday.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 to _______ in a subject = oktatni egy t\u00e1rgyban (pl. She was hired to _______ students in advanced mathematics.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 to _______ on safety procedures = oktatni biztons\u00e1gi elj\u00e1r\u00e1sokr\u00f3l (pl. All new employees are _______ed on safety procedures.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 to _______ a lawyer = \u00fcgyv\u00e9det megb\u00edzni\/utas\u00edtani (pl. He decided to _______ a lawyer to handle his case.)<\/p>","front_notes":null,"front_speak":null,"back":"<p><strong>instruct<\/strong><\/p><p>adjective: <strong>instructive<\/strong><\/p><p>adverb: <strong>instructively<\/strong><\/p><p>noun: <strong>instruction<\/strong><\/p><p>verb: <strong>instruct<\/strong><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #3b82f6\">common pair: instruct someone \/ instruct on \/ instruct to \/ instruct a lawyer<\/span><\/p><p>similar: teach \/ educate \/ train \/ direct \/ command<\/p><p><span style=\"color: #ef4444\">negative: mislead \/ misguide \/ confuse<\/span><\/p>","back_notes":null,"back_speak":null,"study_direction":"front_to_back","color":"#6366f1","review":{"state":"learning","interval":0,"lapses":0,"is_leech":false},"previews":{"again":"1 perc","hard":"2 perc","good":"10 perc","easy":"2 nap"},"other_side_due_at":"2026-05-16T19:09:17+00:00"},{"id":51324,"front":"<p>After the divorce, the parents fought bitterly over the legal _______ of their children. <em>(gyermekfel\u00fcgyelet \/ fel\u00fcgyeleti jog)<\/em><\/p><p>The suspect was taken into police _______ for questioning regarding the robbery. <em>(\u0151rizet \/ letart\u00f3ztat\u00e1s)<\/em><\/p><p>The ancient manuscript is kept under strict _______ in the museum&#039;s secure archives. <em>(\u0151rz\u00e9s \/ fel\u00fcgyelet)<\/em><\/p><p>The judge awarded sole _______ of the estate to the eldest son. <em>(gondnoks\u00e1g \/ vagyonkezel\u00e9s)<\/em><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #22c55e\">\u0151rizet \/ fel\u00fcgyelet \/ gondnoks\u00e1g<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"background-color: #f3f4f6; padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px\">Negative meaning (HU): szabads\u00e1g \/ elenged\u00e9s \/ f\u00fcggetlens\u00e9g<\/span><\/p><p>\ud83d\udd11 Tanul\u00e1si megjegyz\u00e9s<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 in _______ = \u0151rizetben (pl. He was taken in _______.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 legal _______ = jogi fel\u00fcgyelet (pl. The court granted legal _______ of the child to the mother.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 sole _______ = kiz\u00e1r\u00f3lagos fel\u00fcgyelet\/gondnoks\u00e1g (pl. She was awarded sole _______ of the children.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 take into _______ = \u0151rizetbe vesz (pl. The police took the suspect into _______.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 award _______ = fel\u00fcgyeletet\/gondnoks\u00e1got \u00edt\u00e9l (pl. The judge will award _______ next week.)<\/p>","front_notes":null,"front_speak":null,"back":"<p><strong>custody<\/strong><\/p><p>noun: <strong>custody<\/strong><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #3b82f6\">common pair: child custody \/ police custody \/ legal custody \/ sole custody<\/span><\/p><p>similar: guardianship \/ detention \/ care \/ supervision<\/p><p><span style=\"color: #ef4444\">negative: freedom \/ release \/ liberty<\/span><\/p>","back_notes":null,"back_speak":"custody","study_direction":"front_to_back","color":"#6366f1","review":{"state":"learning","interval":0,"lapses":0,"is_leech":false},"previews":{"again":"1 perc","hard":"2 perc","good":"10 perc","easy":"2 nap"},"other_side_due_at":"2026-05-16T17:19:34+00:00"},{"id":51302,"front":"<p>She felt herself grow dizzy and __________, so she sat down quickly. <em>(el\u00e1jul \/ rosszul lesz)<\/em><\/p><p>The old photograph had a __________ sepia tone, making the faces barely visible. <em>(halv\u00e1ny \/ fak\u00f3)<\/em><\/p><p>Despite the strong evidence, the defendant offered only a __________ denial. <em>(gyenge \/ er\u0151tlen)<\/em><\/p><p>A __________ hope flickered in his heart that he might still find his way home. <em>(halv\u00e1ny \/ gyenge)<\/em><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #22c55e\">el\u00e1jul \/ halv\u00e1ny \/ gyenge<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"background-color: #f3f4f6; padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px\">Negative meaning (HU): er\u0151s \/ \u00e9l\u00e9nk \/ \u00f6ntudatos<\/span><\/p><p>\ud83d\udd11 Tanul\u00e1si megjegyz\u00e9s<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 feel _________ = rosszul \u00e9rzi mag\u00e1t, el\u00e1jul (pl. He felt faint after donating blood.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 a _________ light = halv\u00e1ny f\u00e9ny (pl. Only a faint light filtered through the curtains.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 a _________ hope = halv\u00e1ny rem\u00e9ny (pl. There was a faint hope that they would be rescued.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 a _________ smell = gyenge szag (pl. I detected a faint smell of smoke.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 a _________ memory = halv\u00e1ny eml\u00e9k (pl. She had only a faint memory of her childhood home.)<\/p>","front_notes":null,"front_speak":null,"back":"<p><strong>faint<\/strong><\/p><p>adjective: <strong>faint<\/strong><\/p><p>adverb: <strong>faintly<\/strong><\/p><p>noun: <strong>faint<\/strong><\/p><p>verb: <strong>faint<\/strong><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #3b82f6\">common pair: faint light \/ faint hope \/ faint smell \/ faint memory<\/span><\/p><p>similar: dizzy \/ weak \/ pale \/ indistinct<\/p><p><span style=\"color: #ef4444\">negative: strong \/ bright \/ clear<\/span><\/p>","back_notes":null,