e global _______ is interconnected.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 save on _______ = takar\u00e9koskodni (pl. We need to save on _______ wherever possible.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 boost the _______ = fellend\u00edteni a gazdas\u00e1got (pl. The government aims to boost the _______.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 political _______ = politikai gazdas\u00e1gtan (pl. Political _______ studies the interaction between politics and economics.)<\/p>","front_notes":null,"front_speak":null,"back":"<p><strong>economy<\/strong><\/p><p>adjective: <strong>economic<\/strong><\/p><p>adverb: <strong>economically<\/strong><\/p><p>noun: <strong>economy<\/strong><\/p><p>verb: <strong>economize<\/strong><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #3b82f6\">common pair: market economy \/ global economy \/ digital economy \/ circular economy<\/span><\/p><p>similar: financial system \/ economic system \/ frugality \/ thrift<\/p><p><span style=\"color: #ef4444\">negative: extravagance \/ wastefulness \/ profligacy<\/span><\/p>","back_notes":null,"back_speak":null,"study_direction":"front_to_back","color":"#6366f1","review":{"state":"learning","interval":0,"lapses":0,"is_leech":false},"previews":{"again":"1 perc","hard":"15 perc","good":"30 perc","easy":"2 nap"},"other_side_due_at":"2026-05-16T17:17:20+00:00"},{"id":51298,"front":"<p>When she heard the news, she called her mother _______ to share it. <em>(azonnal \/ r\u00f6gt\u00f6n)<\/em><\/p><p>The manager expects the report to be submitted _______ after the meeting concludes. <em>(halad\u00e9ktalanul \/ azonnal)<\/em><\/p><p>Upon receiving the distress signal, the rescue team set off _______. <em>(azonnal \/ r\u00f6gt\u00f6n)<\/em><\/p><p>He knew _______ that he had made a mistake, even before anyone else reacted. <em>(azonnal \/ r\u00f6gt\u00f6n)<\/em><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #22c55e\">azonnal \/ r\u00f6gt\u00f6n \/ halad\u00e9ktalanul<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"background-color: #f3f4f6; padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px\">Negative meaning (HU): k\u00e9s\u0151bb \/