nces for the company&#039;s future. <em>(v\u00e9gzetes \/ s\u00falyos \/ komoly)<\/em><\/p><p>The ancient burial ground contained many unmarked _______s. <em>(s\u00edrhely \/ temetkez\u00e9si hely)<\/em><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #22c55e\">s\u00falyos \/ komoly \/ s\u00edr<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"background-color: #f3f4f6; padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px\">Negative meaning (HU): jelent\u00e9ktelen \/ vid\u00e1m \/ k\u00f6nnyed<\/span><\/p><p>\ud83d\udd11 Tanul\u00e1si megjegyz\u00e9s<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 a _______ situation = s\u00falyos helyzet (pl. The country faced a grave situation after the earthquake.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 in _______ danger = komoly vesz\u00e9lyben (pl. The missing hikers were in grave danger as night fell.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 a _______ error = s\u00falyos hiba (pl. Making such a grave error could cost him his job.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 to dig a _______ = s\u00edrhelyet \u00e1sni (pl. They had to dig a grave for the fallen soldier.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 from the _______ to the cradle = a s\u00edrt\u00f3l a b\u00f6lcs\u0151ig (ford\u00edtva: a b\u00f6lcs\u0151t\u0151l a s\u00edrig)<\/p>","front_notes":null,"front_speak":null,"back":"<p><strong>grave<\/strong><\/p><p>adjective: <strong>grave<\/strong><\/p><p>adverb: <strong>gravely<\/strong><\/p><p>noun: <strong>grave<\/strong><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #3b82f6\">common pair: grave concern \/ grave consequences \/ grave danger \/ grave error<\/span><\/p><p>similar: serious \/ somber \/ solemn \/ critical<\/p><p><span style=\"color: #ef4444\">negative: trivial \/ light \/ minor<\/span><\/p>","back_notes":null,"back_speak":null,"study_direction":"back_to_front","color":"#6366f1","review":{"state":"learning","interval":0,"lapses":0,"is_leech":false},"previews":{"again":"1 perc","hard":"45 perc","good":"1 \u00f3ra","easy":"2 nap"},"other_side_due_at":"2026-05-13T12:17:03+00:00"},{"id":51310,"front":"<p>The government is expected to _______ a state of emergency due to the escalating crisis