. He was a complete _______ when it came to asking her out.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 feel like a _______ = gy\u00e1v\u00e1nak \u00e9rzi mag\u00e1t (pl. I felt like a _______ for not speaking up.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 call someone a _______ = gy\u00e1v\u00e1nak nevez valakit (pl. He called me a _______ for refusing to jump.)<\/p>","front_notes":null,"front_speak":null,"back":"<p><strong>wimp<\/strong><\/p><p>adjective: <strong>wimpy<\/strong><\/p><p>noun: <strong>wimp<\/strong><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #3b82f6\">common pair: total wimp \/ big wimp \/ scared wimp \/ little wimp<\/span><\/p><p>similar: coward \/ chicken \/ milksop \/ weakling<\/p><p><span style=\"color: #ef4444\">negative: hero \/ brave \/ daredevil<\/span><\/p>","back_notes":null,"back_speak":"wimp\nwimpy","study_direction":"front_to_back","color":"#6366f1","review":{"state":"learning","interval":0,"lapses":0,"is_leech":false},"previews":{"again":"1 perc","hard":"2 perc","good":"10 perc","easy":"2 nap"},"other_side_due_at":"2026-05-13T21:56:57+00:00"},{"id":51310,"front":"<p>The government is expected to _______ a state of emergency due to the escalating crisis. <em>(kihirdet \/ bejelent)<\/em><\/p><p>She decided to _______ her love for him openly, despite the potential consequences. <em>(kinyilv\u00e1n\u00edt \/ vall)<\/em><\/p><p>All goods brought into the country must be properly _______ at customs. <em>(bev\u00e1mol \/ bejelent)<\/em><\/p><p>The artist chose to _______ his new exhibition with a bold and provocative statement. <em>(megnyit \/ bevezet)<\/em><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #22c55e\">kijelent \/ kinyilv\u00e1n\u00edt \/ bejelent<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"background-color: #f3f4f6; padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px\">Negative meaning (HU): elhallgat \/ titkol \/ tagad<\/span><\/p><p>\ud83d\udd11 Tanul\u00e1si megjegyz\u00e9s<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 to _______ war = h\u00e1bor\u00fat \u00fczen\/kihirdet (pl. Nations often _______ war after diplomatic efforts fail.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 to _