171 \/ \u00e9terikus)<\/em><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #22c55e\">k\u00eds\u00e9rteties \/ szellemszer\u0171 \/ spektr\u00e1lis<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"background-color: #f3f4f6; padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px\">Negative meaning (HU): val\u00f3s\u00e1gos \/ k\u00e9zzelfoghat\u00f3 \/ anyagi<\/span><\/p><p>\ud83d\udd11 Tanul\u00e1si megjegyz\u00e9s<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ analysis = spektr\u00e1lis anal\u00edzis (pl. The lab conducted _______ analysis to identify the unknown substance.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ presence = k\u00eds\u00e9rteties jelenl\u00e9t (pl. Many reported a _______ presence in the old mansion.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ light = spektr\u00e1lis f\u00e9ny \/ k\u00eds\u00e9rteties f\u00e9ny (pl. The aurora borealis displayed a dazzling array of _______ light.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ silence = k\u00eds\u00e9rteties csend (pl. A _______ silence fell over the empty stadium.)<\/p>","front_notes":null,"front_speak":null,"back":"<p><strong>spectral<\/strong><\/p><p>adjective: <strong>spectral<\/strong><\/p><p>adverb: <strong>spectrally<\/strong><\/p><p>noun: <strong>spectrum<\/strong><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #3b82f6\">common pair: spectral analysis \/ spectral presence \/ spectral light \/ spectral image<\/span><\/p><p>similar: ghostly \/ phantom \/ eerie \/ supernatural<\/p><p><span style=\"color: #ef4444\">negative: real \/ tangible \/ corporeal<\/span><\/p>","back_notes":null,"back_speak":"spectral\nspectrally","study_direction":"back_to_front","color":"#6366f1","review":{"state":"new","interval":0,"lapses":0,"is_leech":false},"previews":{"again":"1 perc","hard":"2 perc","good":"10 perc","easy":"2 nap"},"other_side_due_at":null},{"id":51322,"front":"<p>The global _______ is facing a period of uncertainty due to various geopolitical factors. <em>(gazdas\u00e1g \/ vil\u00e1ggazdas\u00e1g)<\/em><\/p><p>She always tries to run her household with great _______, making sure to save money wherever possible. <em>(takar\u00e9koss\u00e1g \/ gazd\u00e1lkod\u00e1s)<\/em><\/p><p>The new car model boasts improved fuel _______, meaning it uses less gasoline per mile. <em>(hat\u00e9konys\u00e1g \/ \u00fczemanyag-fogyaszt\u00e1s)<\/em><\/p><p>The government announced a new stimulus package to boost the struggling local _______. <em>(gazdas\u00e1g \/ helyi gazdas\u00e1g)<\/em><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #22c55e\">gazdas\u00e1g \/ takar\u00e9koss\u00e1g \/ gazd\u00e1lkod\u00e1s<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"background-color: #f3f4f6; padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px\">Negative meaning (HU): pazarl\u00e1s \/ t\u00e9kozl\u00e1s \/ vesztes\u00e9g<\/span><\/p><p>\ud83d\udd11 Tanul\u00e1si megjegyz\u00e9s<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 market _______ = piacgazdas\u00e1g (pl. A market _______ relies on supply and demand.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 global _______ = vil\u00e1ggazdas\u00e1g (pl. The global _______ is interconnected.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 save on _______ = takar\u00e9koskodni (pl. We need to save on _______ wherever possible.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 boost the _______ = fellend\u00edteni a gazdas\u00e1got (pl. The government aims to boost the _______.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 political _______ = politikai gazdas\u00e1gtan (pl. Political _______ studies the interaction between politics and economics.)<\/p>","front_notes":null,"front_speak":null,"back":"<p><strong>economy<\/strong><\/p><p>adjective: <strong>economic<\/strong><\/p><p>adverb: <strong>economically<\/strong><\/p><p>noun: <strong>economy<\/strong><\/p><p>verb: <strong>economize<\/strong><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #3b82f6\">common pair: market economy \/ global economy \/ digital economy \/ circular economy<\/span><\/p><p>similar: financial system \/ economic system \/ frugality \/ thrift<\/p><p><span style=\"color: #ef4444\">negative: extravagance \/ wastefulness \/ profligacy<\/span><\/p>","back_notes":null,"back_speak":null,"study_direction":"back_to_front","color":"#6366f1","review":{"state":"learning","interval":0,"lapses":0,"is_leech":false},"previews":{"again":"1 perc","hard":"15 perc","good":"30 perc","easy":"2 nap"},"other_side_due_at":"2026-05-16T17:18:48+00:00"},{"id":51320,"front":"<p>After years of practice, she became incredibly _______ in playing the piano, effortlessly performing complex pieces. <em>(\u00fcgyes \/ j\u00e1rtas)<\/em><\/p><p>To be truly _______ in a foreign language, one must not only understand grammar but also grasp cultural nuances. <em>(foly\u00e9kony \/ magabiztos)<\/em><\/p><p>The new software engineer is highly _______ in Python and C++, making him a valuable asset to the development team. <em>(szak\u00e9rt\u0151 \/ kompetens)<\/em><\/p><p>Her _______ command of legal terminology impressed the judges during the trial. <em>(mesteri \/ kiv\u00e1l\u00f3)<\/em><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #22c55e\">j\u00e1rtas \/ \u00fcgyes \/ szak\u00e9rt\u0151<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"background-color: #f3f4f6; padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px\">Negative meaning (HU): \u00fcgyetlen \/ tudatlan \/ hozz\u00e1 nem \u00e9rt\u0151<\/span><\/p><p>\ud83d\udd11 Tanul\u00e1si megjegyz\u00e9s<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ in something = j\u00e1rtas valamiben (pl. He is proficient in several programming languages.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 highly _______ = nagyon j\u00e1rtas (pl. She is highly proficient at public speaking.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 become _______ = j\u00e1rtass\u00e1 v\u00e1lik (pl. With practice, you will become proficient.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ user = j\u00e1rtas felhaszn\u00e1l\u00f3 (pl. The software is designed for proficient users.)<\/p>","front_notes":null,"front_speak":null,"back":"<p><strong>proficient<\/strong><\/p><p>adjective: <strong>proficient<\/strong><\/p><p>adverb: <strong>proficiently<\/strong><\/p><p>noun: <strong>proficiency<\/strong><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #3b82f6\">common pair: proficient in \/ highly proficient \/ become proficient \/ proficient user<\/span><\/p><p>similar: skilled \/ competent \/ expert \/ adept<\/p><p><span style=\"color: #ef4444\">negative: unskilled \/ incompetent \/ inexperienced<\/span><\/p>","back_notes":null,"back_speak":"proficient\nproficiently\nproficiency","study_direction":"back_to_front","color":"#6366f1","review":{"state":"new","interval":0,"lapses":0,"is_leech":false},"previews":{"again":"1 perc","hard":"2 perc","good":"10 perc","easy":"2 nap"},"other_side_due_at":null},{"id":51306,"front":"<p>Let me _______ you to a nice dinner tonight to celebrate your promotion. <em>(megh\u00edv \/ vend\u00e9g\u00fcl l\u00e1t)<\/em><\/p><p>The doctor decided to _______ her with a new experimental drug for her rare condition. <em>(kezel \/ gy\u00f3gy\u00edt)<\/em><\/p><p>It&#039;s important to _______ all employees fairly, regardless of their background. <em>(b\u00e1nik \/ viszonyul)<\/em><\/p><p>My grandmother always has a special _______ for me when I visit, usually homemade cookies. <em>(finoms\u00e1g \/ jutalomfalat)<\/em><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #22c55e\">kezel \/ b\u00e1nik \/ vend\u00e9gel \/ jutalom<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"background-color: #f3f4f6; padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px\">Negative meaning (HU): elhanyagol \/ rosszul b\u00e1nik \/ b\u00fcntet<\/span><\/p><p>\ud83d\udd11 Tanul\u00e1si megjegyz\u00e9s<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ someone to something = megh\u00edv valakit valamire, vend\u00e9g\u00fcl l\u00e1t valakit valamivel (pl. He offered to _______ her to a movie.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ a disease\/illness = betegs\u00e9get kezel (pl. The new medication can effectively _______ certain types of cancer.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ someone fairly\/badly = tisztess\u00e9gesen\/rosszul b\u00e1nik valakivel (pl. You should always _______ others with respect.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 a special _______ = k\u00fcl\u00f6nleges finoms\u00e1g\/jutalom (pl. The ice cream was a real _______ on such a hot day.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 a _______ for the eyes = szemnek kellemes l\u00e1tv\u00e1ny (pl. The beautiful garden was a real _______ for the eyes.)<\/p>","front_notes":null,"front_spea